  "why_not_on_mainnet": "Superseded, and by our own transaction. This said the payment token was owner-minted with no faucet, so no wallet here could hold any. It trades on PancakeSwap: swap 0x63a1b95c\u202678f2 bought 0.2058 of it for 0.0003 BNB, and job 56681 was escrowed with it on mainnet. What this fork run proves is still the flow; what it no longer explains is why the flow had not been run.",
